      "meaning": "Sends an information request to a named person for the exact fields One already proposed with propose_information_request, with the stated purpose and duration. Runs only from a proposal id that tool returned, so the person never handles field identifiers; One asks once in words, then calls this with confirmed set to true. Never call it before propose_information_request has resolved the person and fields.",
